      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عطّن</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعْطِينٌ</span>, <i>He made for himself
an</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَطَن</span> [q. v.]: (K, TA:) like as one says of a
bird <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عشّش</span>, meaning “ he made for himself an
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُشّ</span> ” [i. e. “ a nest ”]. (TA.) ― 
